Description: Functions to fill structural zeros in population projection
    matrices using Bayesian priors. Implements the multinomial-Dirichlet
    model for transition probabilities and Gamma-Poisson model for
    reproduction, as described in Tremblay et al. (2021)
    <doi:10.1016/j.ecolmodel.2021.109526>.
URL: https://atiretoo.github.io/raretrans/,
    https://github.com/atiretoo/raretrans
